      "name": "iTwinShareUpdater.js",
      "filePath": ".github/actions/update-tokens/iTwinShareUpdater.js",
      "summary": "通过 iTwin 平台 REST API 获取 IMS 访问令牌、查询现有 share 并为指定 iTwin 创建新的 share 以签发 Cesium ion 共享密钥，供 token 自动更新流程调用。",
      "tags": ["service", "api-client", "token-management", "itwin", "rest-api"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "纯 Node.js fetch + fs/promises 实现，无第三方依赖；导出 getNewKeyForItwin 作为编排入口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:.github/actions/update-tokens/index.js",
